     "text": "restraint of mind is good;"
    },
    {
     "n": 8,
     "text": "everywhere, restraint is good."
    },
    {
     "n": 9,
     "text": "The mendicant restrained everywhere"
    },
    {
     "n": 10,
     "text": "is released from all suffering."
    },
    {
     "n": 11,
     "text": "One restrained in hand and foot,"
    },
    {
