    {
     "n": 82,
     "text": "reflect on yourself."
    },
    {
     "n": 83,
     "text": "A mendicant self-controlled and mindful"
    },
    {
     "n": 84,
     "text": "will always dwell in happiness."
    },
    {
     "n": 85,
     "text": "Self is indeed the lord of self,"
    },
    {
     "n": 86,
     "text": "for who else would be one’s lord?"
    },
    {
     "n": 87,
     "text": "Self is indeed the home of self,"
