     "n": 89,
     "text": "as a merchant his thoroughbred steed."
    },
    {
     "n": 90,
     "text": "A monk full of joy"
    },
    {
     "n": 91,
     "text": "trusting in the Buddha’s teaching,"
    },
    {
     "n": 92,
     "text": "would realize the peaceful state,"
